entation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e第二章 第一幕「不动鸣神，恒常乐土」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3882","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"3rj588dcl19T1783579300194\":[\"ui8izgn9yihT1783579380706\"],\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[\"3rj588dcl19T1783579300194\",\"l3taoibqvbdT1783579304780\"],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\",\"vonjx1qh1kT1783579370417\"],\"b82143nfw9tT1783579398105\":[\"nvxwa3thgqsT1783579409944\"],\"klms2a0jxi9T1783579431272\":[],\"l3taoibqvbdT1783579304780\":[\"ui8izgn9yihT1783579380706\"],\"mr7hddjc5o8T1783579422042\":[\"klms2a0jxi9T1783579431272\"],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[\"ui8izgn9yihT1783579380706\"],\"nvxwa3thgqsT1783579409944\":[\"mr7hddjc5o8T1783579422042\"],\"ui8izgn9yihT1783579380706\":[\"b82143nfw9tT1783579398105\"],\"vonjx1qh1kT1783579370417\":[\"ui8izgn9yihT1783579380706\"],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[\"ui8izgn9yihT1783579380706\"]},\"contents\":{\"3rj588dcl19T1783579300194\":{\"option\":\"【你的丈夫？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我们本来约好，等攒够了钱，就去花见坂盘一间铺子，这样的话就有更多人能尝到我们的手艺了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…可就在两年前那个秋天，他不听我劝，偏要顶着大雨去进货，结果…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如今，我纪念他的最好的方式，就是经营好这个小摊，守护我们共同的回忆了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e希望客官能多来惠顾，这样亡夫的在天之灵，也能得到慰藉吧…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"option\":\"【关于这家店…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这个小吃摊…之前啊，是我丈夫拉着我一起开的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我本不想做这行生意，起早又贪黑，我丈夫他身体又不好，时间长了怎么吃得消呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e只是我丈夫说，很喜欢看别人吃到我手作料理时露出的笑容…最后啊，我还是拗不过他。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e呵呵，欢迎光临，要来一些特色小吃吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"b82143nfw9tT1783579398105\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e欢迎光临，客人是来离岛参加光华容彩祭的把？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e现在只是布展阶段，人还不是很多，等到正式开幕，离岛就会比现在热闹得多吧，呵呵。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"klms2a0jxi9T1783579431272\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"l3taoibqvbdT1783579304780\":{\"option\":\"【你的厨艺一定很好吧？】——获得干烧香鱼*4\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e呵呵，这位客人可真会讲话。我虽不是名厨，但对稻妻小吃的调味可是很有一手哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e来，这里刚好新做了一些吃的，客人不如趁热尝尝看？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e看您是外国人呢，若是不合您的口味，以后可以为您特别调整哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【获得\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2419\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/09/25/24077343/bd75bab043748c972952dfa96c47a85d_6509349796464523887.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"干烧香鱼\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"4\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2419/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2419/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/09/25/24077343/bd75bab043748c972952dfa96c47a85d_6509349796464523887.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e干烧香鱼\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*4\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/07/09/288180982/b26706122e54335e75a99308e473cc62_7528274539105897240.png\"},\"mr7hddjc5o8T1783579422042\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e欢迎光临，客人是来离岛参加光华容彩祭的把？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e祭典非常热闹，祝您玩得愉快，但也不要忘记填饱肚子哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e要是一直忙着排队买东西得花，很容易体力不支，甚至在烈日下晕倒的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这种时候，就来凉子我这里补充能量吧，呵呵。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"option\":\"【我想买些小吃。】——打开商店界面\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e您好，菜单在这里哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/07/09/288180982/11ee64c710e3b091256c0d349ac55461_6354350431784051816.png\"},\"nvxwa3thgqsT1783579409944\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【光华容彩祭期间 祭典开始后】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ui8izgn9yihT1783579380706\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【光华容彩祭期间 祭典开始前】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"vonjx1qh1kT1783579370417\":{\"option\":\"【再见。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e慢走哦，随时恭候您的再次光临…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"option\":\"【冒险挑战】——进行七圣召唤对局【牌手五级解锁】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e【胜利】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没想到您的牌技如此精湛，思考很累吧，要不要买点什么吃的…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e【失败】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e呵呵，看来客人您要再好好考虑一下牌组的构成呢…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/07/09/288180982/cc2a44c2e85425afbbd461e49fe0875d_309739669964945674.png\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"秘闻馆情报","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"8697","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1783588089","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"8697","pos":"left"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1209","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"693","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1210","pos":"banner"},{"id":"3885","pos":"